# A key that is read off an array may be undefined. The update takes it as an int32 and restarts the iteration otherwise.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = TypeTest {{*}} testedType=i32
# CHECK: PutContiguousIndex
# A key that is made before the loop is tested there.
# RUN(INVARIANT): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# INVARIANT: = TypeTest {{*}} testedType=i32
# INVARIANT: isLoopHead=true
# INVARIANT: = GetArrayElement {{*}} arrayStorage=
# An array that is filled with Infinity holds doubles.
